'''Dragon League Swordsman''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.1.1 Update|Version 3.1.1]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage from the [[Dragon League Collaboration Event|Dragon League and Battle Cats]] collaboration event.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 156
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Dragon League Swordsman
|name2 = Dragon League Witch
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Dragon League Witch''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has pretty much no use at all, regardless of where in the game you are. Early in the game, his stats are very poor, his upgrade cost is too high to improve his usage and there are always better picks for his role, such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]], [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]], and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]]. Later on, his pathetic range makes him nothing more than a meatshield whose speed and cost are easily outclassed by other, more common meatshields, such as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]], Tank Cat and their [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|counterparts]], especially against Dark enemies, as they deal too much damage against Dragon League Swordsman, even with his ability. A spammed horde of Dragon League Swordsmen could barely hold off some [[Doge Dark]]s, as their base stats are simply too low.

